        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623550/extras/63f1c664d3dd20d67ef7be6c04b2f9d2.avif?t=1758007335\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br>Welcome to the world of Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure games — a genre that combines story-driven exploration with keen-eyed observation and clever thinking. In this point-and-click mystery, you’ll search richly detailed scenes for cleverly concealed objects and solve a wide variety of puzzles and brain teasers along the way. It’s like stepping into an interactive mystery novel — you’re not just reading the story, you’re living it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623550/extras/c92e0a257c4894cb25be9dcff75b508e.avif?t=1758007335\" width=616 height=431 /></span><br>When the Young Detective Club visits a prestigious art gallery for the unveiling of the long-lost Renaissance painting “The Knights’ Oath,” they expect culture — not danger. But sharp-eyed George spots something off: the brushwork, the canvas, the whole painting feels… fake. With his friends Thomas and Emily, he sets out to uncover the truth. What begins as a simple forgery investigation quickly spirals into a web of secrets, puzzles, and clues hidden for centuries. The painting may be fake — but the danger is all too real.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623550/extras/bf5aa953e00c0998b2e2b46b14be18e8.avif?t=1758007335\" width=616 height=431 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a thrilling mix of classic hidden object scenes and inventive mini-games. Each location is a beautifully crafted challenge designed to test your attention to detail and puzzle-solving smarts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Collector's Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Test your detective instincts with mysteries adults can’t crack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Discover curious collectibles and hidden lore throughout the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Solve dozens of unique puzzles and relaxing mini-games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Hunt through an abundance of hidden object scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Unlock achievements that reveal key pieces of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Explore chilling and atmospheric locations, each rich in secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Enjoy beautifully illustrated scenes packed with interactive surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve got what it takes to see what others miss? Join the Young Detective Club and dive into a shadowy mystery full of suspense, secrets, and surprises. The truth is waiting — hidden in plain sight!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623550/extras/63f1c664d3dd20d67ef7be6c04b2f9d2.avif?t=1758007335\" width=600 height=230 /></span><br>Welcome to the world of Hidden Object Puzzle Adventure games — a genre that combines story-driven exploration with keen-eyed observation and clever thinking. In this point-and-click mystery, you’ll search richly detailed scenes for cleverly concealed objects and solve a wide variety of puzzles and brain teasers along the way. It’s like stepping into an interactive mystery novel — you’re not just reading the story, you’re living it!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623550/extras/c92e0a257c4894cb25be9dcff75b508e.avif?t=1758007335\" width=616 height=431 /></span><br>When the Young Detective Club visits a prestigious art gallery for the unveiling of the long-lost Renaissance painting “The Knights’ Oath,” they expect culture — not danger. But sharp-eyed George spots something off: the brushwork, the canvas, the whole painting feels… fake. With his friends Thomas and Emily, he sets out to uncover the truth. What begins as a simple forgery investigation quickly spirals into a web of secrets, puzzles, and clues hidden for centuries. The painting may be fake — but the danger is all too real.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623550/extras/bf5aa953e00c0998b2e2b46b14be18e8.avif?t=1758007335\" width=616 height=431 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in a thrilling mix of classic hidden object scenes and inventive mini-games. Each location is a beautifully crafted challenge designed to test your attention to detail and puzzle-solving smarts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Collector's Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Test your detective instincts with mysteries adults can’t crack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Discover curious collectibles and hidden lore throughout the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Solve dozens of unique puzzles and relaxing mini-games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Hunt through an abundance of hidden object scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Unlock achievements that reveal key pieces of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Explore chilling and atmospheric locations, each rich in secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵🏻‍♂️ Enjoy beautifully illustrated scenes packed with interactive surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you’ve got what it takes to see what others miss? Join the Young Detective Club and dive into a shadowy mystery full of suspense, secrets, and surprises. The truth is waiting — hidden in plain sight!</p>",
